    routePath: 'caribbean-stud',
    LLM: 'Game: Caribbean Stud Poker. 52-card. Player vs dealer. 5 cards each (1 dealer card face-up). Player: fold (lose Ante) or raise (2Ã— Ante). Dealer qualifies with A-K+. Payouts by hand rank. Progressive jackpot side bet optional.',
    Player: "Your hand: Aâ™ -Kâ™¦-Qâ™£-Jâ™¥-9â™ . Dealer shows Kâ™¥ face-up. You have A-K high. Optimal rule: raise if dealer's up-card (K) matches something in your hand â€” and you hold Kâ™¦. RAISE. Your A-K-Q-J-9 is strong; if dealer doesn't qualify you win Ante automatically.",
    tagline: 'Five cards. One decision. Fold or fight.',
